# AllowanceAgent — progress.md (Sprint 2)

## Sprint 2: Learner Role + HTTP Transport + x402 + Bug Fixes

### Approach Taken
Three parallel workstreams: (A) Learner role with child-scoped data access and source-tagged achievements, (B) dual transport (stdio + HTTP) with x402 micropayment gating on paid tools, (C) five bug fixes from Sprint 1 evaluation. OpenMAIC integration is Claude-orchestrated — AllowanceAgent receives achievement data with source provenance, doesn't call OpenMAIC directly. New `release-savings` tool closes the locked-forever gap.

