### Failed Approaches
_Sprint 1 failed approaches (carried forward for reference):_
- OWS `signAndSend` for distributions → nonce mismanagement → replaced with viem walletClient
- OWS `signTransaction` + manual broadcast → signature parsing issues → replaced with viem
- `process.cwd()` for dataDir → fails in Claude Desktop → fixed with `import.meta.url`
- MCP SDK global RBAC intercept → SDK doesn't support it → per-tool guard pattern
